# The service runs on the shared runtime from Microsoft's aspnetcore-runtime-10.0 and
# dotnet-runtime-10.0, which keep each patch in a folder named for its version. An update deletes
# the old folder and adds the next, and the running process keeps the runtime it started with:
# unpatched in memory, and with any framework assembly it has yet to load gone from disk. These
# interests make dpkg run postinst with "triggered" once at the end of any run that changed either
# folder, and that case restarts the service.
#
# noawait because nothing about the runtime package depends on the restart having happened.
interest-noawait /usr/share/dotnet/shared/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App
interest-noawait /usr/share/dotnet/shared/Microsoft.NETCore.App
